---

<section id="bio" class="py-20 bg-[#0c0d11] border-t border-zinc-900">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 text-left">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Bio</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm">Connection through music.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <img
          src="/images/about-banner.webp"
          alt="Ro Halfhide"
          class="w-full rounded object-cover shadow-md"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light">
        <p>
          Ro Halfhide is a singer-songwriter whose music aims to recharge listeners, provide hope, and foster connection. His pop songs are infused with soul and offer a reflection of real life experiences, both the highs and lows, with lyrics and melodies that speak directly to the heart.
        </p>

        <p>
          Ro's background as a fusion of two cultures is a source of inspiration for him in his search for connection in his music and life. The central theme in his music is the message that everyone belongs.
        </p>

        <p>
          Ro has been on Dutch national TV numerous times, in the last years with his band for mentally handicapped people Wimpie & de Domino's.
        </p>

        <p>
          Ro has produced albums for well known singer-songwriters like Lucky Fonz III and Case Mayfield. He also toured in Indonesia with Robin Block, a Dutch artist of Indonesian descent.
        </p>

        <p class="pt-2 text-zinc-400 text-xs">
          For sync & licensing, contact <a href="mailto:halfhide@gmail.com" class="text-zinc-200 underline">halfhide@gmail.com</a>. Looking for an acoustic cover duo for private events? Visit <a href="https://reaumusic.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-zinc-200 underline">ReauMusic.nl</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
